[00:27.813]Ex tenuī filo lucis texor,

[00:36.614]sine vultu, sine certā vi.

[00:45.294]In me manūs quondam mollī

[00:51.454]signa levia reliquērunt mihi.

[01:00.688]Non habeō spīritum spīritum spīritumnec flātum.

[01:10.872]Vela susurrant in reverberīs

[01:18.982]docent quid servandī, quid transeundī.

[01:31.320]Aspicis, vīvō.

[01:39.930]Per umbram sine fīne vagī,

[01:48.616]vocātum non sonīs sed radiī.

[01:56.408]Oculīs clausīs intellegitur,

[02:04.006]quod sub corde mundī humilīs latet.

[02:12.599]Non habeō spīritum spīritum spīritum nec flātum.

[02:22.305]Auria resonant in sacrīs vīlīs

[02:30.983]indicant quid orandī, quid sperandī.

[02:38.767]Aspicis, vīvō.

[02:41.970]Stillant tenebrae

[02:45.744]ubī vēritās erat.

[02:50.863]Memorīa manāt intus vērī

[02:55.718]q silentia ferunt sibi.

[02:59.247]Umbrārum via currit alibī

[03:07.832]sed sēnsus manet levis.

[03:18.762]Immortāle spirat in arcānīs

[03:27.455]suadet quid manendī, quid abeundī.